spans.s:
(II)--a son of विजिताश्व and नभस्वती. His queen was हविर्धानी who was the mother of बर्हिषद् and five other sons;
1: भा. IV. २४. 5 and 8.
attained heaven by tapas;
2: Br. II. ३०. ४०.
a राजऋषि and a tapassiddha.
3: वा. ५७. १२२.

(I)--is Agni (होहीय) sent by Indra to disturb the love of उमा and शन्कर;
1: Br. II. १२. २८. III. १०. २४; ११. ३७.
cursed by उमा to bear the burdens of maternity;
2: वा. ७२. २१-8.
he in his turn requested गन्गा to share it.
